### 正常系：CNレポートバックデータ作成
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-report-backdata/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
  "agreement_category": "01",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "consent_route": "○○可視化事業者",
  "start_year": 2023,
  "start_month": 4,
  "end_year": 2025,
  "end_month": 3
}

### エラー系：corporate_number 不足
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-report-backdata/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agreement_category": "01",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "consent_route": "○○可視化事業者",
  "start_year": 2023,
  "start_month": 4,
  "end_year": 2025,
  "end_month": 3
}

### エラー系：consent_route 不足
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-report-backdata/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "1234567890123",
  "agreement_category": "01",
  "org_id": "ORG001",
  "start_year": 2023,
  "start_month": 4,
  "end_year": 2025,
  "end_month": 3
}

### エラー系：全パラメータnull
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/cn-report-backdata/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
